# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Smart Contract Deployment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Copy this file to .env and fill in your values
# cp .env.example .env
#
# ⚠️ SECURITY: Never commit .env file to git!
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DEPLOYER PRIVATE KEY
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚠️ CRITICAL: This is the private key that will deploy contracts
# - Create a new wallet specifically for deployment
# - Fund it with Arbitrum Sepolia ETH for testnet
# - Fund it with Arbitrum ETH for mainnet
# - KEEP THIS SECRET! Never share or commit this key!
#
# Must include 0x prefix
PRIVATE_KEY=0x_your_private_key_here

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ETHERSCAN API KEY (V2 - works for all chains)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used to verify contracts on Arbiscan and other explorers
# Get your API key from: https://etherscan.io/myapikey
# One key works for Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon, and 60+ chains
ETHERSCAN_API_KEY=your_etherscan_api_key_here

# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# QUICK START GUIDE
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env
# 2. Get testnet ETH from: https://faucet.quicknode.com/arbitrum/sepolia
# 3. Fill in PRIVATE_KEY and ETHERSCAN_API_KEY in .env
# 4. Run: npm install
# 5. Run: npm run deploy:testnet
# 6. Save the deployed contract addresses
# 7. Verify contracts: npx hardhat verify --network arbitrumSepolia <ADDRESS> <CONSTRUCTOR_ARGS>
